          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sunil Das"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"This is the premium commuter for the sensible buyer. It delivers the essential Ather performance, the full long range, and all the crucial smart safety features, without the luxury price tag of the top Z-trim.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Vijay Patel"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The DeepView display is great in bright sunlight, with excellent clarity and auto-brightness adjustment. It’s simple, functional, and doesn't overheat or lag like some of the budget screens I tested.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Meera Taneja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The optional Frunk (22L) storage space is a genius accessory. It separates my lunch box and water bottle from the helmet in the main boot, solving a massive daily convenience issue.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Harshit Singh"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The connectivity features like Crash Alert (which notifies emergency contacts) and Push Navigation from my phone straight to the dash are genuinely useful. Ather's software ecosystem is its true USP.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Anil Sastry"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The combination of a Disc front brake and the dependable CBS stopping system is adequate. However, a rear disc brake should have been standard on the 'Pro' feature pack for better high-speed deceleration.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Kavita Joshi"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The home charging time of 4 hours 30 minutes (0-80%) is decent for a battery this size, meaning I can easily top it up over a long lunch break or a quick evening stop at home.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Prakash Varma"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The extended 8-year/80,000 km battery warranty that came with the Pro Pack is the ultimate peace of mind. It fully mitigates the biggest risk of EV ownership and justifies the premium pricing.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Divya"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The acceleration to 80 km/hr is brisk, but it’s a controlled performance, not a wild one. It's the perfect balance for a family scooter—quick when you need it, and calm when you don't.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Manish Kulkarni"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 159 km certified range is the reason I chose the 3.7 kWh pack. The real-world mileage I get (around 125 km) gives me total freedom to use the fast Ather Grid network only when truly necessary.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sanjana Dubey"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The Reverse Mode and AutoHold™ on slopes are essential safety nets for navigating my cramped apartment parking lot. This scooter is designed with real-world Indian urban challenges in mind.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Ritesh Saxena"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"For a premium price (around ₹1.45 Lakh), the LCD screen feels like a compromise compared to the touchscreens of rivals. It's clear, but I miss the full interactivity and vibrant graphics of the 450X's display.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Neha Kulkarni"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"My favorite feature is the SkidControl™ (traction control). Riding through rainy Mumbai roads used to be scary, but this system makes the acceleration feel secure and stable, even on slippery patches.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Deepak Chopra"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"Ather's build quality is superb. The long, flat seat is genuinely the most comfortable on any scooter I've owned. It handles bumps well, and the 34L boot space is vast enough for my daily work and shopping needs.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Gaurav Tandon"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The Magic Twist™ feature is revolutionary for a family scooter. It makes slowing down in traffic seamless and helps regenerate power effortlessly. The instant torque is smooth, not jerky, ideal for carrying a pillion.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Priya Varma"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 3.7 kWh battery is a lifesaver for long city days, giving me 120 km easily! Choosing the 'S Pro' variant meant I got the huge range and all the necessary smart features like AutoHold™ without paying for the expensive Z-trim's display. Perfect value.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.6,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"shriram"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta is a friendly scooter with great value for money. It offers a comfortable ride and meets most customer requirements, though some may find it bulky.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"sapna kumari"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a great scooter for daily city commutes. The storage capacity is huge, and Ather's connectivity features are excellent. The ride quality is also good, even on rough roads.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"gita lata"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I'm proud to own the Ather Rizta. It's an amazing scooter with a futuristic design and comfortable ride. The only drawback is the limited range and lack of advanced features.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"saraj deen"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta is a great option for city rides, offering a smooth ride and good performance. However, the charging time is a bit long.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"rukmani"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've enjoyed riding the Rizta for its agility and comfort. However, the after-sales service experience could be better.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"bhagirath"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a good scooter, but it lacks in terms of practicality for heavier riders and those seeking more advanced features.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"balbir"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta offers a fantastic riding experience with its smooth ride and good performance. However, the limited range and charging infrastructure are drawbacks.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"balkrishnan"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the Rizta's range and handling. It's agile and fun to ride, though the service experience could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"arnab paul"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a great option for those seeking an eco-friendly scooter. It's fun to ride, but the lack of advanced features is noticeable compared to other models.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"ajay yadav"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I love the Rizta for its futuristic design and comfortable ride. It's a great value for money, though the charging time could be faster.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"abhishek kumar"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta is a solid choice for city rides. It offers a smooth ride and good performance, though the price is a bit steep for some buyers.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"abdur rahman"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've had mixed experiences with the Rizta. While it's efficient and eco-friendly, there have been some issues with charging infrastructure and limited range.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"amar"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the Rizta's handling and features. It's agile and fun to ride, though the weight can be a bit much for some riders.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"july parween"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a great scooter for daily commutes. It offers a comfortable ride and good performance, though the range could be better for longer trips.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"kesi reddy"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been using the Ather Rizta for a month now, and it's been a fantastic experience. The ride quality is excellent, and the design is sleek. However, the charging time is a bit long.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}}]

